WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 28

01:27.800 --> 01:30.830
(Virtues Run Far)

01:30.850 --> 01:32.080
No!

01:32.100 --> 01:34.570
Si cannot marry Prince Yan!

01:34.660 --> 01:36.180
Do you hear yourself?

01:36.180 --> 01:37.280
Brother,

01:37.300 --> 01:39.110
are you too excited

01:39.130 --> 01:40.360
to remain rational?

01:40.380 --> 01:41.900
I'm more rational than anyone!

01:41.900 --> 01:43.130
This marriage

01:43.130 --> 01:45.360
cannot happen!

01:45.380 --> 01:47.000
Tell me why.

01:47.020 --> 01:48.950
What's wrong with it?

01:48.970 --> 01:51.080
Marrying a prince is
stepping into a web of intrigue.

01:51.100 --> 01:53.110
We can't put Si in harm's way!

01:53.130 --> 01:54.160
Look at you

01:54.180 --> 01:56.750
being so paranoid.

01:56.770 --> 01:58.380
Yes.

01:58.620 --> 01:59.530
At the banquet,

01:59.530 --> 02:01.020
Prince Yan gave all the roses

02:01.020 --> 02:02.720
to Si.

02:02.740 --> 02:04.230
He truly loves her.

02:04.250 --> 02:05.420
He'll protect her.

02:05.420 --> 02:07.280
Si will be fine!

02:07.300 --> 02:09.260
You don't understand!

02:10.090 --> 02:11.250
I won't allow

02:11.250 --> 02:12.610
this marriage.

02:13.020 --> 02:14.940
The edict has been issued.

02:15.090 --> 02:17.380
It's been settled.

02:18.140 --> 02:19.510
Marriage requires

02:19.530 --> 02:22.100
parents' approval.

02:22.210 --> 02:23.730
Come here, Ancheng.

02:25.740 --> 02:27.100
Come here!

02:30.460 --> 02:33.030
You've been idling the days away

02:33.050 --> 02:34.300
in the house these years.

02:34.300 --> 02:35.210
You have no idea

02:35.210 --> 02:37.120
about the situation outside!

02:37.140 --> 02:38.350
Mother,

02:38.370 --> 02:39.790
she can marry anyone

02:39.810 --> 02:41.440
except for Prince Yan!

02:41.460 --> 02:42.790
Why?

02:42.810 --> 02:45.140
He's a wonderful young man.

02:45.620 --> 02:47.880
When he came to visit,

02:47.900 --> 02:50.560
didn't you keep praising him?

02:50.580 --> 02:51.420
Back then,

02:51.420 --> 02:53.030
I didn't know who he really was.

02:53.050 --> 02:54.850
So what if you know now?

02:56.250 --> 02:57.740
I'm done talking to you!

02:57.740 --> 02:59.040
- Brother.
- Come back!

02:59.040 --> 03:01.680
(Cixin Hall)
Brother!

03:05.250 --> 03:07.450
Don't be mad, Mother.

03:08.020 --> 03:09.770
He simply

03:09.770 --> 03:11.730
loves his daughter too much

03:12.300 --> 03:13.160
to process the fact

03:13.180 --> 03:15.630
that she'll get married and leave.

03:15.650 --> 03:17.330
But that's inevitable.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.380
He'll come around.

03:19.530 --> 03:21.120
I hope so.

03:21.140 --> 03:23.450
Who doesn't love their children?

03:23.470 --> 03:26.500
- Right.
- But your brother is

03:26.770 --> 03:28.650
so not himself today.

03:28.650 --> 03:29.720
What happened?

03:29.740 --> 03:32.820
This is your favorite. Try it, Your Grace.

03:33.740 --> 03:35.300
Please eat something, Your Grace.

03:35.300 --> 03:36.750
If you collapse,

03:36.770 --> 03:37.650
the Grand Princess

03:37.650 --> 03:39.790
will kill all of us, Your Grace.

03:39.810 --> 03:41.170
I said no.

03:41.620 --> 03:43.770
You hear me? No!

03:49.980 --> 03:51.570
You may leave.

03:59.370 --> 04:00.730
Are you scalded?

04:05.860 --> 04:08.260
Didn't you promise me that?

04:09.340 --> 04:12.550
Why was Jiang Si betrothed to him,

04:12.570 --> 04:14.840
not me?

04:14.860 --> 04:16.640
There, there.

04:16.660 --> 04:19.260
Jiang Si doesn't deserve him.

04:19.570 --> 04:21.410
His Majesty's betrothal

04:21.490 --> 04:24.260
is a nail in her coffin.

04:25.130 --> 04:27.870
A nail in her coffin? What do you mean?

04:27.890 --> 04:29.430
Have I ever

04:29.450 --> 04:30.870
made a promise to you

04:30.890 --> 04:32.940
that I failed to deliver?

04:37.660 --> 04:39.210
Si,

04:39.860 --> 04:42.060
it's all my fault.

04:43.050 --> 04:44.130
Had I married you

04:44.130 --> 04:46.470
into an ordinary family earlier,

04:46.490 --> 04:47.810
you wouldn't have

04:47.810 --> 04:50.620
ended up in this death trap.

04:51.570 --> 04:52.640
Father,

04:52.660 --> 04:55.060
it's not as gruesome as you say.

04:57.130 --> 04:58.860
Why were you of all those girls

04:58.860 --> 05:00.550
betrothed to Prince Yan?

05:00.570 --> 05:02.420
He must've played tricks

05:02.420 --> 05:03.670
under the table.

05:03.690 --> 05:05.550
I'm going to confront him now!

05:05.570 --> 05:07.470
Father, if you go,

05:07.490 --> 05:09.320
others will think

05:09.340 --> 05:11.160
I might've been fooling around with him

05:11.180 --> 05:13.140
since a long time ago.

05:14.220 --> 05:16.570
Please calm down.

05:16.890 --> 05:20.080
Prince Yan is a good man.

05:20.100 --> 05:21.570
And...

05:22.050 --> 05:23.650
And I

05:24.010 --> 05:25.820
adore him.

05:27.010 --> 05:28.620
Oh, silly,

05:28.810 --> 05:31.080
you're too naive.

05:31.100 --> 05:32.860
A good man

05:32.860 --> 05:35.430
might not be a good husband.

05:35.450 --> 05:37.690
Not to mention, he's hardly good!

05:37.690 --> 05:38.640
Otherwise,

05:38.660 --> 05:41.280
he wouldn't have fooled us.

05:41.300 --> 05:42.870
He didn't fool us.

05:42.890 --> 05:44.650
Actually, I knew

05:44.810 --> 05:46.570
he was a prince.

05:46.660 --> 05:48.410
He hid it for a reason.

05:48.860 --> 05:50.320
I think

05:50.340 --> 05:52.940
given his personality and integrity,

05:53.130 --> 05:55.090
I can trust him with my life.

05:55.420 --> 05:56.400
After all,

05:56.420 --> 05:57.370
our life is

05:57.370 --> 05:58.860
up to us.

05:59.810 --> 06:00.840
Si,

06:00.860 --> 06:02.570
are you sure

06:02.570 --> 06:04.140
he'll never betray you?

06:04.180 --> 06:06.080
Don't forget he's a prince.

06:06.100 --> 06:07.250
If he falls in love

06:07.250 --> 06:08.400
with someone else later,

06:08.420 --> 06:11.110
there's nothing you can do.

06:11.130 --> 06:12.420
You can't divorce him

06:12.420 --> 06:13.350
even if you want to.

06:13.370 --> 06:14.400
Look, Father,

06:14.420 --> 06:15.840
His Majesty has issued

06:15.860 --> 06:17.320
the edict of betrothal.

06:17.340 --> 06:18.640
Whether I like it or not,

06:18.660 --> 06:20.140
what can I do?

06:20.690 --> 06:22.060
Feign illness.

06:22.250 --> 06:25.280
Then I'll sneak you out of the city.

06:25.300 --> 06:26.810
You can marry someone else

06:26.810 --> 06:28.200
or go wherever you like.

06:28.220 --> 06:30.490
You'll live a carefree life anyway.

06:30.490 --> 06:31.960
That's most important.

06:31.980 --> 06:32.980
I can't live in the dark

06:32.980 --> 06:35.030
for the rest of my life.

06:35.050 --> 06:36.600
I just want to be myself,

06:36.620 --> 06:39.570
be Earl Dongping's daughter.

06:39.740 --> 06:40.720
Father,

06:40.740 --> 06:43.090
trust me. It's really not that bad.

06:47.180 --> 06:48.650
Prince Yan,

06:49.130 --> 06:50.570
can we hire some maids

06:50.570 --> 06:52.530
to attend to the mansion?

06:52.780 --> 06:53.760
This place is much bigger

06:53.760 --> 06:55.340
than the courtyard in Zaoshu Lane.

06:55.340 --> 06:57.600
Long Dan can't handle everything alone.

06:57.620 --> 06:58.860
Once Princess Yan arrives,

06:58.860 --> 07:00.350
there will be maids.

07:00.370 --> 07:01.540
I used to hold a sword

07:01.540 --> 07:02.640
to kill enemies.

07:02.660 --> 07:04.400
Now, I'm holding a rag to do cleaning.

07:04.420 --> 07:06.890
An imperial wedding is

07:07.340 --> 07:10.860
too complicated and elaborate.

07:12.130 --> 07:14.570
I'm worried that my dear Si will be worn out.

07:14.810 --> 07:17.200
You care so much about her, Chief.

07:17.220 --> 07:19.740
Our room needs Pear Agarwood Incense.

07:19.780 --> 07:20.840
Si likes its scent.

07:20.860 --> 07:22.330
Prepare enough of it.

07:22.490 --> 07:24.530
Everything in this courtyard

07:24.740 --> 07:26.430
needs to be rearranged

07:26.450 --> 07:28.210
to her taste.

07:28.370 --> 07:30.300
Also, she loves

07:30.620 --> 07:31.960
crabapple trees.

07:31.980 --> 07:33.910
Plant more of those.

07:33.930 --> 07:35.700
Fine. Noted.

07:36.180 --> 07:37.930
When Si and I

07:37.930 --> 07:40.450
have children,

07:41.180 --> 07:43.700
we'll name our son...

07:47.660 --> 07:50.670
And we'll call our daughter...

07:50.690 --> 07:52.630
What? What's your son's name?

07:52.650 --> 07:53.490
And your daughter's?

07:53.490 --> 07:54.670
I didn't get that, Chief.

07:54.690 --> 07:56.050
Good.

08:32.580 --> 08:34.010
Ke,

08:35.580 --> 08:37.650
when Yi got married,

08:38.860 --> 08:40.770
I came to tell you the news.

08:42.370 --> 08:44.140
A while ago,

08:44.650 --> 08:46.650
she moved back home.

08:47.770 --> 08:49.690
I was afraid to let you know.

08:51.130 --> 08:53.220
She's doing fine, though.

08:53.290 --> 08:54.810
Don't worry.

08:55.770 --> 08:57.140
Now,

08:57.410 --> 08:59.100
our youngest, Si,

09:02.490 --> 09:04.530
is also getting married.

09:07.220 --> 09:09.080
You shouldn't have got out of bed.

09:11.890 --> 09:13.290
I'm fine.

09:16.580 --> 09:19.100
I want to take another look at our home,

09:23.370 --> 09:25.010
at you.

09:26.130 --> 09:27.490
Ancheng,

09:28.650 --> 09:29.580
am I no longer pretty

09:29.580 --> 09:31.690
in your eyes?

09:37.100 --> 09:38.460
Darling,

09:38.860 --> 09:40.600
in my eyes,

09:40.620 --> 09:42.810
you're always the prettiest.

09:46.770 --> 09:48.840
Aren't you a sweet talker?

09:48.860 --> 09:49.990
Of course.

09:50.010 --> 09:51.200
Who else

09:51.220 --> 09:52.740
could I sweet-talk?

09:57.490 --> 09:58.890
Ancheng,

09:59.650 --> 10:01.500
you mean

10:02.170 --> 10:04.140
the most to me.

10:06.530 --> 10:08.170
I've never regretted

10:08.170 --> 10:09.690
marrying you.

10:12.060 --> 10:13.770
Please

10:14.100 --> 10:16.650
take care of our children.

10:17.370 --> 10:20.290
Don't let them get hurt.

10:21.290 --> 10:22.410
Don't worry too much.

10:22.410 --> 10:24.170
You'll be fine, Ke.

10:25.650 --> 10:27.200
As long as you're with me,

10:28.340 --> 10:30.690
our children will be fine.

10:42.980 --> 10:45.100
Stay with me!

10:45.820 --> 10:47.500
Ke!

10:47.510 --> 10:51.240
♪ Spring is as green ♪

10:51.260 --> 10:54.550
♪ In vain she's lean ♪

10:54.860 --> 10:56.220
(Si, )

10:56.740 --> 10:58.130
(I promised your mother)

10:58.130 --> 11:00.290
(to take care of all of you.)

11:01.530 --> 11:03.010
(There's something)

11:03.010 --> 11:05.170
(I can't tell you.)

11:05.370 --> 11:07.010
(That's exactly why I tried to)

11:07.010 --> 11:09.220
(stop you from marrying a prince.)

11:10.980 --> 11:12.340
(Ke, )

11:12.580 --> 11:16.530
(please bless Si and keep her safe.)

11:19.320 --> 11:21.440
(Morning Drizzle)

11:21.440 --> 11:23.800
(Haitang Chamber)

11:29.980 --> 11:31.340
Miss!

11:38.770 --> 11:41.100
Miss. Miss, are you alright?

11:43.860 --> 11:45.220
Miss!

11:45.770 --> 11:47.600
Miss, you... you're coughing up blood!

11:47.620 --> 11:49.750
Miss! Help! Help!

11:49.770 --> 11:50.720
Stay with me, Miss!

11:50.740 --> 11:51.960
Help!

11:51.980 --> 11:53.340
Coughed up blood?

11:53.700 --> 11:55.990
Why didn't you tell me at once last night?

11:56.010 --> 11:57.800
Last night, she said she was sleepy,

11:57.820 --> 11:59.560
thinking she'd be fine after resting.

11:59.580 --> 12:01.350
However, she wasn't up yet at noon.

12:01.370 --> 12:03.080
I tried to wake her up but failed.

12:03.100 --> 12:05.390
Call a physician now!

12:05.410 --> 12:07.220
I already have.

12:07.410 --> 12:09.140
Why did she cough up blood?

12:09.770 --> 12:10.870
Did she eat

12:10.890 --> 12:12.600
or drink something bad?

12:12.620 --> 12:14.010
Think!

12:14.220 --> 12:15.580
She had...

12:15.700 --> 12:17.060
Ginger soup!

12:17.170 --> 12:19.460
She had ginger soup from Ms. Xiao.

12:20.360 --> 12:22.640
(Haitang Chamber)

12:23.700 --> 12:25.060
Brother.

12:25.340 --> 12:27.470
- Mother.
- We heard Si fell sick.

12:27.490 --> 12:28.650
Mother came to check on her.

12:28.670 --> 12:29.640
Did you call a physician?

12:29.640 --> 12:30.550
Save it, Ms. Xiao!

12:30.550 --> 12:31.490
Don't play innocent!

12:31.490 --> 12:32.720
Last night, she had ginger soup

12:32.720 --> 12:33.960
from you,

12:33.980 --> 12:35.140
causing her to cough up blood.

12:35.140 --> 12:37.110
Thankfully, I forgot to wash the bowl.

12:37.130 --> 12:39.050
Or the evidence would've been gone!

12:41.130 --> 12:42.350
Was that soup from you?

12:42.370 --> 12:43.510
Say it!

12:43.530 --> 12:44.840
What's wrong with that soup?

12:44.860 --> 12:46.340
Don't blame me for things I didn't do.

12:46.340 --> 12:47.990
Mother, last night,

12:48.010 --> 12:49.350
one of my senior maids

12:49.370 --> 12:51.150
splashed water all over Si by accident.

12:51.170 --> 12:52.150
To prevent a cold,

12:52.170 --> 12:54.680
I brought her a bowl of ginger soup.

12:54.700 --> 12:56.220
What's wrong with it?

12:58.130 --> 13:00.010
What are you doing, Mrs. Li?

13:07.220 --> 13:08.060
Mrs. Li

13:08.060 --> 13:10.150
was the meanest.

13:10.170 --> 13:12.080
She had no respect for you.

13:12.100 --> 13:13.890
Now, she's changed

13:14.060 --> 13:16.170
and had them bring you bath water.

13:17.860 --> 13:19.530
She's the same.

13:19.580 --> 13:21.470
She used to bully us because we were weak.

13:21.490 --> 13:23.630
Now that you're going to be a princess,

13:23.650 --> 13:25.460
I dare her to tread on us again.

13:31.580 --> 13:32.680
Are you burning

13:32.700 --> 13:35.100
Pear Agarwood Incense tonight again?

13:36.290 --> 13:38.320
As pear juice blends in agarwood,

13:38.340 --> 13:40.630
the sweet scent lingers.

13:40.650 --> 13:42.410
It's the best incense for sleep.

13:44.530 --> 13:47.600
Si, may I come in?

13:47.620 --> 13:48.980
Open the door.

13:49.980 --> 13:51.340
Ms. Xiao.

13:52.010 --> 13:53.580
It's late, Aunt Xiao.

13:54.130 --> 13:55.530
What brings you here?

13:55.740 --> 13:57.440
I came to bring you ginger soup.

13:57.460 --> 13:59.800
Just now, I noticed her fluster

13:59.820 --> 14:01.890
and pushed her to tell me the truth.

14:02.490 --> 14:03.620
You see, Mrs. Li

14:03.620 --> 14:05.350
didn't do that on purpose.

14:05.370 --> 14:08.270
I made this bowl of ginger soup.

14:08.290 --> 14:09.560
Take it while it's hot

14:09.580 --> 14:10.800
to warm your body

14:10.820 --> 14:12.340
in case you catch a cold.

14:15.620 --> 14:17.460
Thanks for the soup.

14:17.740 --> 14:20.050
I'll take it.

14:20.580 --> 14:21.940
Aman.

14:22.250 --> 14:23.440
No need to trouble yourself

14:23.460 --> 14:25.460
with such things again, though.

14:25.890 --> 14:27.930
Si, I know

14:28.410 --> 14:29.770
I was

14:29.860 --> 14:31.630
such a fool

14:31.650 --> 14:33.510
and did terrible things to you.

14:33.530 --> 14:35.320
The future of our clan

14:35.340 --> 14:37.410
relies on you.

14:37.490 --> 14:38.720
Our two branches

14:38.740 --> 14:39.840
should support each other.

14:39.860 --> 14:41.110
What poison did you use?

14:41.130 --> 14:42.290
I poisoned her?

14:42.290 --> 14:43.860
You won't admit it?

14:43.940 --> 14:44.980
Once the physician arrives,

14:44.980 --> 14:46.380
he'll find out!

14:47.010 --> 14:49.680
You're defaming an innocent person!

14:49.700 --> 14:50.560
We need no physician.

14:50.580 --> 14:52.040
You said the soup was poisoned, huh?

14:52.060 --> 14:53.040
I'll take the rest

14:53.060 --> 14:54.420
to prove myself!

14:59.770 --> 15:02.270
Zhan is too worried about his sister.

15:02.290 --> 15:04.140
Don't take it to heart.

15:05.290 --> 15:06.650
Mother,

15:07.060 --> 15:08.920
I did make mistakes,

15:08.940 --> 15:10.840
and I annoyed tons of people,

15:10.860 --> 15:12.470
but all that I did was

15:12.490 --> 15:14.800
for the sake of our clan.

15:14.820 --> 15:15.920
Look, Mother.

15:15.940 --> 15:17.600
Right now, even a maid

15:17.620 --> 15:20.320
can falsely accuse me

15:20.340 --> 15:23.010
of poisoning my own niece!

15:23.980 --> 15:27.010
Mother, I'm too humiliated

15:27.010 --> 15:29.560
to keep staying in this house.

15:29.580 --> 15:32.170
Please let me go, Mother.

15:33.620 --> 15:35.320
Alright. That's enough.

15:35.340 --> 15:36.700
Get up already.

15:36.940 --> 15:38.300
Get up.

15:39.100 --> 15:40.740
Although you're Si's maid,

15:40.740 --> 15:42.720
you've crossed the line

15:42.740 --> 15:44.870
by slandering the mistress of this house.

15:44.890 --> 15:46.720
Drag her out.

15:46.740 --> 15:47.800
Lock her in the woodshed

15:47.820 --> 15:49.130
with no food for a day and a night

15:49.130 --> 15:50.050
so that she'll learn to

15:50.060 --> 15:52.150
watch her mouth!

15:52.170 --> 15:54.010
- Grandmother!
- I need to look after Miss Si!

15:54.010 --> 15:56.200
Shut up! You don't have a say here!

15:56.220 --> 15:57.580
Move it!

15:59.620 --> 16:00.520
Grandmother,

16:00.540 --> 16:01.810
Aman lost her head for the moment

16:01.810 --> 16:03.040
and talked wildly.

16:03.580 --> 16:04.470
Si is still sick.

16:04.490 --> 16:05.680
Aman has to attend to her!

16:05.700 --> 16:06.840
Yes, Mother.

16:06.860 --> 16:08.010
Please let her stay

16:08.010 --> 16:09.150
to look after Si.

16:09.170 --> 16:11.630
Is there no other maid

16:11.650 --> 16:13.290
in this big house

16:13.290 --> 16:15.860
to take care of Si?

16:16.100 --> 16:17.270
Maybe

16:17.290 --> 16:19.040
it was Aman

16:19.060 --> 16:20.170
who made Si

16:20.170 --> 16:21.750
eat something bad,

16:21.770 --> 16:22.770
causing my poor niece

16:22.770 --> 16:25.170
to fall ill!

16:25.820 --> 16:26.700
Right now,

16:26.700 --> 16:28.270
do I need approval

16:28.290 --> 16:31.380
from you two to punish a maid?

16:43.250 --> 16:44.150
Not sick?

16:44.170 --> 16:45.680
But why did she cough up blood?

16:45.700 --> 16:47.580
Why is she still in a coma?

16:47.740 --> 16:49.440
- Well...
- That's right.

16:49.460 --> 16:52.050
Coughing up blood and a coma...

16:52.580 --> 16:53.940
Ancheng,

16:54.450 --> 16:55.620
is her condition the same

16:55.620 --> 16:57.210
as that of Su...?

16:57.500 --> 16:59.250
No, no, no. It can't be!

17:00.130 --> 17:02.320
Physician Xu,

17:02.340 --> 17:03.370
I remember

17:03.370 --> 17:05.890
you examined Su as well.

17:07.300 --> 17:08.390
You remind me of that.

17:08.410 --> 17:10.580
Their symptoms are quite similar.

17:10.820 --> 17:12.040
After Ms. Su gave birth,

17:12.060 --> 17:13.840
she coughed up blood and fainted.

17:13.860 --> 17:15.760
Her condition rapidly worsened.

17:15.780 --> 17:17.390
A few days later,

17:17.410 --> 17:19.540
she died of heart failure.

17:20.060 --> 17:21.320
I went through

17:21.340 --> 17:22.480
all the medical books

17:22.500 --> 17:23.910
but didn't find the cause.

17:23.930 --> 17:25.670
Master, you also hired

17:25.690 --> 17:26.950
all the skilled physicians

17:26.970 --> 17:27.870
in town,

17:27.890 --> 17:30.040
but none of them could help her.

17:30.060 --> 17:32.620
No! Impossible!

17:33.060 --> 17:34.260
Si couldn't have

17:34.260 --> 17:36.860
caught the same disease as her mother!

17:37.020 --> 17:38.150
I'm really sorry.

17:38.170 --> 17:39.690
Please excuse me.

17:39.820 --> 17:41.730
This way, please, Physician Xu.

17:44.930 --> 17:45.890
Could it be

17:45.890 --> 17:48.430
a genetic disease?

17:48.450 --> 17:49.600
No way.

17:49.620 --> 17:51.430
Were it genetic,

17:51.450 --> 17:52.630
how come Zhan and Yi

17:52.650 --> 17:54.450
turned out fine?

17:54.620 --> 17:56.430
- Right.
- Si

17:56.450 --> 17:58.320
was always healthy.

17:58.340 --> 17:59.970
It must've been Aman's fault

17:59.970 --> 18:01.340
that Si fell sick.

18:01.970 --> 18:03.000
Mother,

18:03.020 --> 18:04.560
let's go to the main hall

18:04.580 --> 18:05.580
and discuss

18:05.580 --> 18:06.800
how to help her.

18:06.820 --> 18:07.910
Si should rest in peace.

18:07.930 --> 18:09.980
- Sure.
- Alright.

18:10.690 --> 18:12.170
Poor girl.

18:12.620 --> 18:14.820
Mrs. Li, stay with her

18:14.820 --> 18:16.730
in case something bad happens again!

18:16.780 --> 18:18.210
Yes, My Lady.

18:18.410 --> 18:19.950
What? Coughed up blood?

18:19.970 --> 18:22.080
- What about Aman?
- Grandmother had her

18:22.100 --> 18:23.040
locked in the woodshed.

18:23.060 --> 18:24.500
I'm going to see Yu.

18:24.500 --> 18:25.860
You go ahead.

18:26.690 --> 18:27.530
Chief,

18:27.550 --> 18:29.350
didn't we buy a little bit too much?

18:29.370 --> 18:30.310
It's once in a lifetime.

18:30.310 --> 18:31.480
She deserves the best.

18:31.500 --> 18:32.860
I can't be cheap!

18:33.210 --> 18:35.210
- I see.
- Hey, Zhan. Why didn't you go in?

18:35.210 --> 18:36.150
You're back!

18:36.170 --> 18:38.080
Help! Bad news!

18:38.100 --> 18:40.450
- What's wrong?
- Si is in a coma!

18:40.650 --> 18:42.010
Chief...

18:50.210 --> 18:51.480
So...

18:51.500 --> 18:52.860
So cold...

18:53.540 --> 18:54.950
So cold... So...

18:54.970 --> 18:56.330
Cold?

18:58.300 --> 18:59.430
Feeling better?

18:59.450 --> 19:00.910
- Hot...
- What about now?

19:00.930 --> 19:02.190
Hot...

19:02.210 --> 19:03.390
So warm!

19:03.410 --> 19:04.670
Feeling cold and then hot.

19:04.690 --> 19:06.410
What have you come down with?

19:06.650 --> 19:08.010
Help!

19:09.450 --> 19:10.290
Anyone there?

19:10.300 --> 19:11.390
That country girl...

19:11.410 --> 19:12.930
Is everyone in this house dead?

19:12.930 --> 19:15.450
(Haitang Chamber)

19:15.450 --> 19:17.060
No one was there.

19:22.650 --> 19:25.520
Miss, Earl Dongping's mansion

19:25.540 --> 19:26.910
has rules.

19:26.930 --> 19:29.150
You aren't in a market.

19:29.170 --> 19:31.240
Please don't shout.

19:31.260 --> 19:32.600
Miss Si is sick.

19:32.620 --> 19:34.150
Saying someone's dead can be a curse.

19:34.170 --> 19:35.840
You know she's sick, huh?

19:35.860 --> 19:36.800
She's ill

19:36.820 --> 19:37.870
while here you're

19:37.890 --> 19:40.000
eating and chatting in her courtyard.

19:40.020 --> 19:42.250
Is this also your rule?

19:43.130 --> 19:44.100
Didn't you tell us

19:44.100 --> 19:45.520
to stay away from her,

19:45.540 --> 19:47.350
and that was Young Master Zhan's order?

19:47.370 --> 19:48.470
You're taking such good care

19:48.470 --> 19:50.000
of Miss Si.

19:50.020 --> 19:51.410
Is it because Young Master Zhan

19:51.410 --> 19:53.100
promised you something?

19:53.970 --> 19:56.760
You know, he's a player.

19:56.780 --> 19:57.860
Don't be fooled

19:57.860 --> 20:00.970
and end up with nothing.

20:09.100 --> 20:11.650
You, fetch a basin of hot water.

20:11.780 --> 20:14.000
You, fetch ice cubes.

20:14.020 --> 20:14.860
And you,

20:14.860 --> 20:16.500
tell the Earl to fetch Imperial Physicians

20:16.500 --> 20:17.430
from the Palace.

20:17.450 --> 20:18.810
Do as I say,

20:18.970 --> 20:20.360
or my dagger will cut

20:20.380 --> 20:21.890
something else next time.

20:34.250 --> 20:35.100
What exactly happened?

20:35.100 --> 20:36.630
Jiang Zhan didn't say much.

20:36.650 --> 20:37.660
Si's said to have the same

20:37.660 --> 20:39.360
strange disease as her mother,

20:40.170 --> 20:42.840
coughing up blood and being in a coma,

20:42.860 --> 20:44.820
leading to heart failure.

20:47.540 --> 20:48.840
I'll call Imperial Physicians.

20:48.860 --> 20:50.760
- You stay with her.
- Hold on!

20:50.780 --> 20:51.960
The Earl just walked them out.

20:51.970 --> 20:53.620
They were a bunch of quacks.

20:53.710 --> 20:55.290
They took her pulse but could do nothing,

20:55.290 --> 20:56.970
not even write a prescription.

21:18.960 --> 21:19.890
I know you've been

21:19.890 --> 21:21.190
trying to protect your family

21:21.210 --> 21:22.730
and lead a peaceful life.

21:22.780 --> 21:24.690
But only if I can keep a foothold

21:24.890 --> 21:26.860
will I be able to protect you.

21:26.890 --> 21:28.240
Didn't you promise

21:28.260 --> 21:29.100
to keep me safe

21:29.100 --> 21:30.390
and protect me?

21:30.410 --> 21:31.580
I thought I'd never

21:31.580 --> 21:33.340
see you again.

21:40.650 --> 21:42.620
What happened to you?

21:45.780 --> 21:48.060
You were fine just a few days ago.

21:57.020 --> 21:58.820
Snake Grass.

22:00.060 --> 22:01.420
Do you mean

22:01.730 --> 22:03.340
you were poisoned by it?

22:06.780 --> 22:08.380
It can cure you?

22:12.170 --> 22:13.530
Snake Grass.

22:13.580 --> 22:14.870
People know

22:14.890 --> 22:16.710
it's highly toxic,

22:16.730 --> 22:17.630
but they don't know

22:17.650 --> 22:20.820
it's also an antidote to various poisons.

22:24.020 --> 22:26.170
Hang in there. Wait for me!

23:48.440 --> 23:50.800
(Haitang Chamber)

24:20.000 --> 24:25.350
♪ It's a long story;
we'll take different paths in this life ♪

24:26.560 --> 24:32.680
♪ The world is changing;
may we find where we belong ♪

24:33.180 --> 24:39.760
♪ I want nothing else; I'll stop for you ♪

24:40.060 --> 24:46.270
♪ I'll give up everything ♪

24:47.280 --> 24:52.920
♪ To write to you, a few words make a book ♪

24:54.180 --> 24:59.940
♪ Mottled fate reaches the end ♪

25:00.610 --> 25:06.990
♪ Hope to embrace eternity with you ♪

25:07.010 --> 25:13.620
♪ As if in a dream, petals fall on the paper ♪

25:13.810 --> 25:17.230
♪ Looking back, everything is ♪

25:17.240 --> 25:20.640
♪ Difficult to untangle ♪

25:20.700 --> 25:26.350
♪ All is to guard my love for you ♪

25:27.580 --> 25:31.070
♪ Morning mist's reduced to dew ♪

25:31.070 --> 25:34.420
♪ The sun rises as usual ♪

25:34.440 --> 25:40.520
♪ In this lifetime,
I only want to be with you ♪

25:41.180 --> 25:44.740
♪ Looking back, everything is ♪

25:44.760 --> 25:48.140
♪ Difficult to untangle ♪

25:48.170 --> 25:53.780
♪ All is to guard my love for you ♪

25:54.890 --> 25:58.460
♪ Morning mist's reduced to dew ♪

25:58.460 --> 26:02.000
♪ The sun rises as usual ♪

26:02.020 --> 26:09.540
♪ In this lifetime,
I only want to be with you ♪

26:18.170 --> 26:21.690
Her Grace's having a much better appetite.

26:21.860 --> 26:24.210
She's eaten up the food we served.

26:25.580 --> 26:27.620
One more thing, Your Highness.

26:28.730 --> 26:30.580
Earl Dongping's Mansion

26:30.620 --> 26:32.950
hired all the physicians in town,

26:32.970 --> 26:35.410
but they failed to remove Jiang Si's poison.

26:35.620 --> 26:38.000
She's on her deathbed.

26:38.020 --> 26:39.540
Your Highness, you'll soon receive

26:39.540 --> 26:41.100
good news.

26:43.260 --> 26:44.970
Everyone is worried about you.

26:45.100 --> 26:47.140
I'll go and tell them you're fine.

26:47.260 --> 26:48.620
Not now.

26:49.890 --> 26:51.490
I didn't catch a disease.

26:51.780 --> 26:53.140
I believe

26:53.890 --> 26:55.340
I was poisoned.

26:56.130 --> 26:57.490
By whom?

26:58.500 --> 27:00.140
It must've been my aunt.

27:00.300 --> 27:01.480
First, her maid

27:01.500 --> 27:03.070
splashed water all over me.

27:03.260 --> 27:04.950
Then she had them bring me bath water.

27:04.970 --> 27:06.950
Finally, she brought me ginger soup

27:06.970 --> 27:09.050
that'd prove her innocence.

27:09.370 --> 27:11.390
All that couldn't have been a coincidence

27:11.410 --> 27:12.970
but all part of her scheme.

27:17.130 --> 27:20.100
Are you going to pretend to be sick

27:20.210 --> 27:22.100
until she gives herself away?

27:25.860 --> 27:27.380
The day has broken.

27:27.730 --> 27:29.410
Let's put on a show

27:30.210 --> 27:31.920
to use her scheme against her.

27:36.020 --> 27:37.450
Your Highness, are you sure

27:37.450 --> 27:38.410
that'll save Si's life?

27:38.410 --> 27:39.270
I've seen someone

27:39.270 --> 27:40.200
- like that.
- Brother.

27:40.200 --> 27:41.280
- It's worth a try.
- Wait!

27:41.280 --> 27:43.110
What now, Xiao?

27:43.130 --> 27:45.870
I understand you're eager to save Si,

27:45.890 --> 27:48.190
but Prince Yan is a stranger.

27:48.210 --> 27:49.350
It's inappropriate for him

27:49.370 --> 27:50.390
to enter her room.

27:50.410 --> 27:52.080
He and Si have engaged.

27:52.100 --> 27:53.480
What stranger?

27:53.500 --> 27:55.320
Her life is more important than anything!

27:55.340 --> 27:56.890
Come with me!

27:58.570 --> 27:59.440
My Lady,

27:59.450 --> 28:01.320
aren't we going to stop him from going in?

28:01.340 --> 28:03.350
Look at them dashing.

28:03.370 --> 28:04.890
How could I stop them?

28:05.060 --> 28:06.930
More words and suspicion will rise.

28:11.340 --> 28:12.780
How's she?

28:13.450 --> 28:14.450
Her pulse

28:14.450 --> 28:16.210
matches that of the patient I saw

28:16.220 --> 28:17.090
years back.

28:17.100 --> 28:18.480
It's going slow and fast.

28:18.500 --> 28:21.060
There's a clot at the Luxi Point
behind her ear.

28:21.340 --> 28:22.730
That matches, too.

28:23.170 --> 28:24.530
Father!

28:26.060 --> 28:27.910
Father, how is Si?

28:27.930 --> 28:28.910
Calm down.

28:28.930 --> 28:30.730
Prince Yan is taking her pulse.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.650
He once saw someone

28:31.650 --> 28:34.210
with similar symptoms in Nanwu.

28:35.170 --> 28:36.640
Is she suffering from the same disease

28:36.640 --> 28:37.720
as my mother?

28:41.450 --> 28:42.670
It's that disease.

28:42.690 --> 28:44.870
The patients will die in a coma.

28:44.890 --> 28:46.280
They feel

28:46.300 --> 28:48.000
hot and cold before that.

28:48.020 --> 28:50.910
Yes! Si was like that yesterday,

28:50.930 --> 28:52.760
saying she felt too hot or too cold.

28:52.780 --> 28:55.000
Is there a cure, Your Highness?

28:55.020 --> 28:56.150
Don't worry.

28:56.170 --> 28:57.760
I have the prescription from years back.

28:57.780 --> 28:58.950
Thank goodness!

28:58.970 --> 28:59.970
Si will be fine, Father!

28:59.970 --> 29:02.080
That's great!

29:02.100 --> 29:03.500
Thanks, Your Highness.

29:05.580 --> 29:07.840
Azhu, fetch enough handkerchiefs

29:07.860 --> 29:08.910
to wipe away Si's sweat.

29:08.930 --> 29:11.410
What should we do, Your Highness?

29:12.410 --> 29:13.770
I'm glad you're here.

29:13.820 --> 29:15.480
I'll tell all of you now. Listen carefully.

29:15.480 --> 29:17.560
Her disease is deteriorating fast.

29:17.580 --> 29:19.150
The decoction can't go wrong.

29:19.170 --> 29:21.560
The timing, heat, and order

29:21.580 --> 29:22.800
shall all be precise.

29:22.820 --> 29:23.970
To make the poisoner

29:23.970 --> 29:25.110
fall into the trap,

29:25.130 --> 29:26.190
the prescription

29:26.210 --> 29:28.250
needs to be demanding.

29:29.020 --> 29:30.520
Aunt Xiao is calculative.

29:30.540 --> 29:32.350
Were it too simple and easy,

29:32.370 --> 29:34.250
she'd see right through our plan.

29:34.540 --> 29:35.800
That's why

29:35.820 --> 29:38.320
it should include three steps at least.

29:38.340 --> 29:40.430
The first dose is to stabilize her.

29:40.450 --> 29:42.320
Decoct it on high heat for two hours.

29:42.340 --> 29:43.560
The second, cool her down.

29:43.580 --> 29:45.350
Decoct it on low heat for four hours.

29:45.370 --> 29:46.390
The last one

29:46.410 --> 29:48.520
is the key to detoxification.

29:48.540 --> 29:50.670
Use morning dew to decoct the herbs

29:50.690 --> 29:52.690
on high heat for three hours

29:52.690 --> 29:54.520
and then on low heat for two more.

29:54.540 --> 29:55.800
My Lady,

29:55.820 --> 29:57.100
plants near venomous snakes

29:57.100 --> 29:58.520
can remove snake venom.

29:58.540 --> 29:59.520
Did Prince Yan

29:59.540 --> 30:01.780
get lucky and find the antidote?

30:03.650 --> 30:05.820
But what are the odds?

30:06.540 --> 30:08.190
Calm down. Don't panic.

30:08.210 --> 30:10.360
Have our people watch her chamber closely.

30:10.380 --> 30:12.060
Find out if they really are decocting herbs

30:12.060 --> 30:13.630
or putting on a show.

30:13.650 --> 30:16.320
Will this cure Si?

30:16.340 --> 30:17.630
Relax.

30:17.650 --> 30:19.010
I don't trust others,

30:19.060 --> 30:21.020
but Qi is trustworthy.

30:31.890 --> 30:33.250
Si...

30:33.730 --> 30:35.250
Si's hand moved!

30:38.450 --> 30:40.000
That jinx!

30:40.020 --> 30:41.820
She just won't die!

30:41.930 --> 30:43.450
Is Yu Qi's prescription

30:43.650 --> 30:45.150
able to remove the poison?

30:45.170 --> 30:46.530
Don't worry.

30:46.780 --> 30:49.340
The last dose is the key.

30:49.370 --> 30:50.930
We still have a chance.

30:53.130 --> 30:54.870
By the way,

30:54.890 --> 30:55.820
one of the herbs

30:55.820 --> 30:56.910
in the third dose

30:56.930 --> 30:58.800
was brought back from Nanwu.

30:58.820 --> 31:00.320
It can't be found in Ling'an.

31:00.340 --> 31:02.190
Without it,

31:02.210 --> 31:04.540
all our efforts will be in vain.

31:04.820 --> 31:06.240
- I see.
- Don't worry.

31:06.260 --> 31:08.150
With all of us here watching the decoction,

31:08.170 --> 31:09.560
nothing will go wrong.

31:10.300 --> 31:11.560
We live and die with it.

31:11.580 --> 31:13.390
(We aren't decocting herbs)

31:13.410 --> 31:14.870
(but testing human nature.)

31:14.890 --> 31:17.300
They've started making the second dose.

31:17.370 --> 31:18.480
There's no time to think.

31:18.500 --> 31:19.500
Once we

31:19.500 --> 31:20.480
ruin the third dose,

31:20.500 --> 31:22.110
even deities

31:22.130 --> 31:23.760
can't save her life.

31:23.780 --> 31:24.870
Then this household will be

31:24.890 --> 31:26.490
fully under your control.

31:28.060 --> 31:29.040
Is that new maid,

31:29.060 --> 31:31.020
Fangqin, in Mother's room,

31:31.170 --> 31:32.620
your niece?

31:33.780 --> 31:35.450
She's as timid as a mouse.

31:35.450 --> 31:37.110
- I'm afraid...
- Enough!

31:37.130 --> 31:38.930
There's no time to be afraid.

31:45.450 --> 31:46.800
Watch the time.

31:46.820 --> 31:48.800
When the last dose is half done,

31:48.820 --> 31:50.450
have Fangqin go and...

31:51.890 --> 31:53.250
Yes.

32:12.100 --> 32:13.350
Did we fall asleep?

32:13.370 --> 32:14.730
We agreed to...

32:17.500 --> 32:19.300
Did you gather all the dew?

32:20.970 --> 32:22.190
Miss Si!

32:22.210 --> 32:23.870
- Aman, you're back.
- Young Master!

32:23.890 --> 32:25.820
How's Miss Si doing?

32:26.130 --> 32:28.860
Is she alright, Your Highness?

32:29.130 --> 32:30.490
Take it easy.

32:35.730 --> 32:37.090
Ms. Yi.

32:37.780 --> 32:39.140
Still unconscious.

32:42.410 --> 32:43.810
Decoct the third dose.

32:45.780 --> 32:47.140
Now!

32:54.210 --> 32:56.380
The final step of our plan is

32:57.020 --> 32:58.690
to give them a chance to act.

32:59.580 --> 33:00.970
When you're away,

33:01.500 --> 33:03.140
they'll do it.

33:10.210 --> 33:11.190
Ms. Yi,

33:11.210 --> 33:13.870
Lady Jiang said you stayed up all night

33:13.890 --> 33:15.030
and had me bring you cakes

33:15.030 --> 33:16.480
in case you're hungry.

33:16.500 --> 33:17.860
Thanks. I'll take it.

33:18.540 --> 33:19.540
Are Prince Yan

33:19.540 --> 33:20.840
and Young Master Zhan inside?

33:20.860 --> 33:22.390
I'll bring the cakes to them.

33:22.410 --> 33:23.770
No need.

33:24.780 --> 33:26.140
Leave that to me.

33:27.060 --> 33:28.320
Prince Yan had to go home.

33:28.340 --> 33:30.100
Please thank Grandmother for us.

33:30.170 --> 33:31.730
Eat the cakes, Ms. Yi.

33:45.930 --> 33:47.430
- My Lady!
- How did it go?

33:47.450 --> 33:49.320
Fangqin went there and checked.

33:49.340 --> 33:51.450
Yu Qi had left to attend to other things.

33:54.210 --> 33:55.890
Brilliant!

33:56.210 --> 33:58.060
Here comes our chance.

33:58.580 --> 34:00.330
Gather some trustworthy guards

34:00.730 --> 34:02.420
to go to the Haitang Chamber

34:02.460 --> 34:03.820
with me!

34:07.100 --> 34:08.360
My Lady,

34:08.380 --> 34:09.630
Fangqin told me

34:09.650 --> 34:11.330
Lady Jiang didn't sleep well last night.

34:11.330 --> 34:12.710
She's taking a nap now.

34:12.730 --> 34:14.270
No one shall disturb her.

34:14.290 --> 34:15.310
The two masters

34:15.330 --> 34:17.020
also left.

34:17.940 --> 34:19.230
You two stand guard here.

34:19.250 --> 34:20.480
Let no one inside.

34:20.500 --> 34:22.240
If anyone asks, just say a thief broke in.

34:22.240 --> 34:23.100
- Yes.
- Yes.

34:23.100 --> 34:24.560
(Peace)

34:28.290 --> 34:29.260
- Search it.
- Yes.

34:29.270 --> 34:30.120
Ms. Xiao,

34:30.130 --> 34:31.360
this is Miss Si's courtyard.

34:31.380 --> 34:33.200
Why break in with so many guards?

34:34.210 --> 34:36.190
Since when do I need your permission

34:36.210 --> 34:37.900
for anything I do?

34:38.170 --> 34:39.710
You see, Miss Aman,

34:39.730 --> 34:40.600
I lost

34:40.620 --> 34:42.920
a gold-clad bracelet.

34:42.940 --> 34:44.480
I've searched everywhere for it

34:44.500 --> 34:46.110
except for this chamber.

34:46.130 --> 34:47.920
So here I am to take a look.

34:47.940 --> 34:49.300
Alright?

34:49.330 --> 34:50.690
Go.

34:51.980 --> 34:53.440
What's all the fuss about?

34:53.460 --> 34:55.480
Aunt Xiao, Si is sick.

34:55.500 --> 34:56.500
It's rude to barge in

34:56.500 --> 34:57.630
with so many people.

34:57.650 --> 34:59.360
Once she wakes up and becomes well,

34:59.380 --> 35:01.330
I'll look for that bracelet with you.

35:03.290 --> 35:04.480
Here's the thing.

35:04.500 --> 35:05.830
That bracelet

35:05.850 --> 35:08.520
is a family heirloom.

35:08.540 --> 35:10.600
When I got married, I got it from my mother.

35:10.620 --> 35:12.340
She got it from her mother

35:12.360 --> 35:13.900
who got it from my great-grandmother.

35:13.920 --> 35:15.790
My great-grandmother got it from her mother.

35:15.810 --> 35:16.650
And just like that,

35:16.650 --> 35:18.270
it's been handed down in our family.

35:18.290 --> 35:20.360
Were it lost in my hands,

35:20.380 --> 35:22.670
how could I live on?

35:22.690 --> 35:24.190
This is a huge mansion

35:24.210 --> 35:25.080
with so many people.

35:25.100 --> 35:25.940
If some servant

35:25.940 --> 35:26.960
got greedy,

35:26.980 --> 35:28.880
sneaking it out to sell it,

35:28.900 --> 35:30.940
I'd never have it back.

35:31.170 --> 35:32.310
Don't worry.

35:32.330 --> 35:33.710
I'll tell them to be quiet.

35:33.730 --> 35:35.420
They won't disturb Si.

35:35.940 --> 35:37.080
Be quiet.

35:37.100 --> 35:38.460
Go!

35:40.580 --> 35:41.940
Stop!

35:42.020 --> 35:43.380
Don't you dare move!

35:45.940 --> 35:47.230
Stop! What...?

35:47.250 --> 35:48.360
What are you doing?

35:48.380 --> 35:49.750
Are you roughing me up?

35:49.770 --> 35:51.130
Aunt Xiao!

35:52.100 --> 35:53.150
What's this?

35:53.170 --> 35:54.730
It's to cure Miss Si!

36:00.540 --> 36:02.100
- How clumsy!
- The decoction...!

36:02.100 --> 36:03.580
It's for Miss Si!

36:03.980 --> 36:05.000
Look.

36:05.020 --> 36:06.440
How careless!

36:06.460 --> 36:07.600
Aunt Xiao, you...!

36:07.620 --> 36:09.940
What? It wasn't me but her.

36:22.540 --> 36:23.900
Aunt Xiao,

36:24.130 --> 36:26.100
didn't you ruin it on purpose?

36:29.060 --> 36:31.690
No wonder I slept in today.

36:31.940 --> 36:33.670
How dare you drug me!

36:33.690 --> 36:35.920
Is there anyone in this house

36:35.940 --> 36:37.420
that you wouldn't dare harm?

36:37.420 --> 36:39.750
Mother, don't believe Jiang Si.

36:39.770 --> 36:41.090
That's only her side of the story.

36:41.090 --> 36:41.920
Grandmother,

36:41.940 --> 36:43.250
thankfully, Prince Yan discovered

36:43.250 --> 36:44.200
her scheme in time

36:44.220 --> 36:45.290
and changed knockout powder

36:45.290 --> 36:46.710
to Soothing Incense.

36:46.730 --> 36:48.360
That wasn't knockout powder

36:48.380 --> 36:50.880
but Soothing Soup for sleep.

36:50.900 --> 36:52.830
Did you think
by putting Grandmother to sleep,

36:52.850 --> 36:54.210
you could ruin the decoction for me

36:54.210 --> 36:55.310
without anyone knowing it?

36:55.330 --> 36:56.920
First, you drugged me.

36:56.940 --> 36:59.190
Then you ruined the cure for your niece.

36:59.210 --> 37:01.080
With the evidence and witnesses here,

37:01.100 --> 37:03.210
what else do you have to say?

37:03.250 --> 37:04.190
Mother,

37:04.210 --> 37:05.130
Jiang Si is fine.

37:05.130 --> 37:06.000
Look at her.

37:06.020 --> 37:07.710
What cure?

37:07.730 --> 37:09.520
She wasn't sick at all.

37:09.540 --> 37:10.880
Yes, Mother.

37:10.900 --> 37:12.560
As you can see,

37:12.580 --> 37:14.330
Si is perfectly healthy.

37:14.330 --> 37:15.670
Nothing bad happened to her.

37:15.690 --> 37:18.380
Your aunt did that by accident.

37:18.380 --> 37:19.740
Uncle,

37:19.850 --> 37:21.900
she barged in and ruined the cure

37:21.940 --> 37:23.560
in the name of looking for her bracelet,

37:23.580 --> 37:25.560
which almost killed Si.

37:25.580 --> 37:27.540
Do you call that an accident?

37:27.620 --> 37:28.880
Fangqin,

37:28.900 --> 37:31.440
did you bring me knockout powder or soup?

37:31.460 --> 37:32.790
Trust me, My Lady!

37:32.810 --> 37:33.690
I wouldn't dare

37:33.690 --> 37:35.480
drug you!

37:35.500 --> 37:36.750
Who sent you?

37:36.770 --> 37:38.980
- Say it!
- Speak!

37:39.810 --> 37:41.170
It was...

37:43.500 --> 37:44.860
It was...

37:46.130 --> 37:47.440
Drug her?

37:47.460 --> 37:49.130
I'd rather die, Aunt.

37:49.130 --> 37:50.190
I wouldn't dare.

37:50.210 --> 37:51.580
If you don't do it,

37:51.620 --> 37:53.400
my being punished is one thing.

37:53.420 --> 37:55.080
There will be no room for us

37:55.100 --> 37:56.040
in this household.

37:56.060 --> 37:57.040
But...

37:57.060 --> 37:59.140
Ms. Xiao is in charge.

37:59.330 --> 38:01.650
Think about your future.

38:02.420 --> 38:04.620
But if anyone finds out...

38:04.810 --> 38:06.250
So what?

38:06.380 --> 38:08.110
By the time Lady Jiang wakes up,

38:08.130 --> 38:10.590
things in Miss Si's chamber
have been dealt with.

38:10.770 --> 38:12.110
Who else will know

38:12.130 --> 38:13.900
or dare to say a word?

38:13.980 --> 38:16.620
Anyway, whether you do it or not

38:16.650 --> 38:18.290
is up to you.

38:18.810 --> 38:20.730
Why look at me?

38:23.500 --> 38:26.040
Mother, she's evil.

38:26.060 --> 38:27.980
She's no better!

38:28.130 --> 38:29.650
She knew Fangqin would drug you

38:29.650 --> 38:31.060
but turned the trick to her own use.

38:31.060 --> 38:32.110
And she feigned illness

38:32.130 --> 38:33.350
to fool all of us!

38:33.370 --> 38:35.230
"Turned the trick to her own use"?

38:35.250 --> 38:36.210
Aunt Xiao, did you admit

38:36.210 --> 38:37.660
that you played a trick?

38:38.460 --> 38:40.790
Servants, drag both of them out.

38:40.810 --> 38:42.400
Flog them 20 times each!

38:42.420 --> 38:45.330
- No, My Lady!
- My Lady!

38:45.540 --> 38:47.290
- My Lady!
- My Lady!

38:47.540 --> 38:49.060
How dare you!

38:49.060 --> 38:50.420
Mother...

38:53.330 --> 38:56.230
Si, that was too audacious of you,

38:56.250 --> 38:58.480
risking your life to set a trap.

38:58.500 --> 39:00.670
You turned this entire house

39:00.690 --> 39:02.290
upside down!

39:02.420 --> 39:05.020
Put others aside. Your father was

39:05.210 --> 39:07.140
worried day and night.

39:07.170 --> 39:08.830
I was inconsiderate,

39:08.850 --> 39:10.750
making you and him concerned.

39:10.770 --> 39:12.650
After Prince Yan helped me wake up,

39:12.770 --> 39:14.360
I realized that I had been poisoned,

39:14.380 --> 39:16.330
so I pretended that I was still sick.

39:17.980 --> 39:19.500
Poisoned?

39:21.060 --> 39:22.360
You weren't sick

39:22.380 --> 39:23.600
but poisoned?

39:23.620 --> 39:24.830
That's right.

39:24.850 --> 39:26.150
The poisoner was

39:26.170 --> 39:27.580
Aunt Xiao!

39:36.900 --> 39:38.810
How did my wife die?

39:40.850 --> 39:42.620
Her symptoms were identical

39:42.620 --> 39:43.920
to Si's.

39:43.940 --> 39:45.560
If you poisoned Si,

39:45.580 --> 39:46.770
had you done

39:46.770 --> 39:48.830
the same to her mother?

39:48.850 --> 39:49.960
What?

39:49.980 --> 39:51.340
Father,

39:51.980 --> 39:53.080
what do you mean?

39:53.100 --> 39:55.980
Is what my brother said true?

39:56.250 --> 39:57.610
I don't know.

39:58.330 --> 39:59.690
I don't know!

40:00.130 --> 40:01.830
I don't know what you're talking about.

40:01.850 --> 40:04.060
I don't know how Su Ke died.

40:04.770 --> 40:06.810
I swear, Mother. I don't know!

40:06.940 --> 40:08.770
It was you

40:09.460 --> 40:11.170
who poisoned my mother!

40:11.290 --> 40:12.420
Did you poison her?

40:12.420 --> 40:14.420
Tell the truth!

40:18.210 --> 40:19.710
Why yell at me?

40:19.730 --> 40:21.650
Su Ke's death was her fate.

40:21.650 --> 40:22.540
She died

40:22.540 --> 40:23.630
a long time ago.

40:23.650 --> 40:27.690
Now, all of you are pinning her death on me?

40:27.690 --> 40:29.110
You think I poisoned her?

40:29.130 --> 40:31.730
Fine. Show me the evidence!

40:31.900 --> 40:33.190
Father!

40:33.210 --> 40:34.670
The night before I fell ill,

40:34.690 --> 40:35.540
you had your maid

40:35.540 --> 40:37.150
splash water all over me.

40:37.170 --> 40:38.880
Then you had them bring me bath water.

40:38.900 --> 40:40.360
Later, you brought me a bowl

40:40.380 --> 40:41.830
of ginger soup without poison.

40:41.850 --> 40:43.810
I have reason to believe

40:44.060 --> 40:45.420
you put

40:45.770 --> 40:47.980
the poison in the bath water!

40:52.580 --> 40:54.020
Si,

40:54.290 --> 40:56.480
as convincing as that sounds,

40:56.500 --> 40:58.150
I'll say it again.

40:58.170 --> 41:01.290
Whether it was before or now

41:01.620 --> 41:03.850
that I used poison like you said,

41:04.020 --> 41:05.750
show me the evidence.

41:05.770 --> 41:08.060
Do you know this kind of flower

41:08.500 --> 41:10.330
with crimson petals

41:10.730 --> 41:13.020
and yellow pollen?

41:13.330 --> 41:15.210
Dissolver it in water

41:16.060 --> 41:16.900
and it'll greatly

41:16.900 --> 41:18.730
nourish the skin.

41:19.330 --> 41:21.370
- Never heard of it.
- Never?

41:21.730 --> 41:22.620
Didn't you dissolve it

41:22.620 --> 41:23.620
in the bath water

41:23.620 --> 41:25.420
for me?

41:28.210 --> 41:30.020
It's so nourishing.

41:31.170 --> 41:33.020
I made a bowl of it

41:33.210 --> 41:35.420
for you to try it!

41:36.170 --> 41:37.110
Darling!

41:37.130 --> 41:38.500
Why are you so terrified?

41:38.500 --> 41:39.540
It's just clear water

41:39.540 --> 41:41.330
with a few petals.

41:42.210 --> 41:44.060
Unless you knew

41:44.130 --> 41:47.730
such flowers were highly toxic!

41:51.330 --> 41:53.170
Who knows she can be

41:53.210 --> 41:54.790
so evil and vicious?

41:54.810 --> 41:57.150
Had I pushed her even the slightest further,

41:57.170 --> 41:59.580
I would've ended up even worse than Su Ke.

42:02.290 --> 42:03.520
Mother,

42:03.540 --> 42:06.210
we'd better leave. Let's go back.

42:06.580 --> 42:07.940
Come on.

42:09.770 --> 42:11.130
Mother!

42:11.540 --> 42:13.060
Mother!

42:14.100 --> 42:17.060
I've devoted my life to this clan.

42:17.810 --> 42:21.080
Now, the First Branch is setting me up!

42:21.100 --> 42:22.080
Grandmother,

42:22.100 --> 42:24.190
this matter concerns my mother's death.

42:24.210 --> 42:25.670
If no one here will uphold justice,

42:25.690 --> 42:27.440
I'll report it to the government

42:27.460 --> 42:28.500
to find the evidence

42:28.500 --> 42:30.110
and get to the bottom of it!

42:30.130 --> 42:31.920
- You can't!
- Get up!

42:31.940 --> 42:33.400
At this point,

42:33.420 --> 42:34.830
you still won't tell the truth?

42:34.850 --> 42:36.130
Be honest with us,

42:36.130 --> 42:38.370
or would you rather go to court?

42:42.900 --> 42:44.460
You slapped me.

42:44.460 --> 42:45.380
I did, so what?

42:45.380 --> 42:47.190
Hadn't it been for you,

42:47.210 --> 42:49.250
how could I've taken one wrong step

42:49.250 --> 42:50.880
after another?

42:50.900 --> 42:53.560
Did you really poison them both?

42:53.580 --> 42:56.370
Ke had done nothing bad to you.

42:57.540 --> 43:00.660
Why did you kill her so brutally?

43:00.680 --> 43:04.960
(The End of Episode 28)

43:05.491 --> 43:07.221
♪ From place to place ♪

43:07.221 --> 43:12.161
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:12.531 --> 43:14.911
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:14.911 --> 43:19.141
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:19.851 --> 43:22.251
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:22.271 --> 43:25.931
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:25.951 --> 43:29.371
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:29.521 --> 43:35.041
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:35.861 --> 43:39.541
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:39.541 --> 43:43.621
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:43.861 --> 43:45.601
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:45.621 --> 43:50.321
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:50.321 --> 43:53.891
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:53.911 --> 43:58.141
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:58.161 --> 43:59.941
♪ Time glows ♪

43:59.941 --> 44:04.481
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:04.501 --> 44:09.301
♪ And stars ♪

44:13.531 --> 44:16.061
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:16.081 --> 44:19.701
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:19.721 --> 44:23.151
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:23.171 --> 44:27.791
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:27.791 --> 44:31.481
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:31.501 --> 44:35.591
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:35.701 --> 44:37.521
♪ Time glows ♪

44:37.521 --> 44:42.071
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:42.091 --> 44:45.791
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:45.811 --> 44:49.971
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:50.151 --> 44:51.911
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:51.911 --> 44:56.431
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:56.431 --> 45:00.071
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

45:00.091 --> 45:05.761
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:07.451 --> 45:09.381
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:09.381 --> 45:16.881
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
